<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>New Task Assigned</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #334155; margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f1f5f9; }
    .container { max-width: 500px; margin: 40px auto; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px -5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; }
    .header { background: #334155; padding: 24px 32px; text-align: center; }
    .header h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; color: #ffffff; }
    .content { padding: 32px; }
    .task-box { background: #f8fafc; border-radius: 6px; padding: 20px; margin: 24px 0; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-left: 4px solid #334155; }
    .task-title { font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; margin: 0; color: #1e293b; }
    .btn-container { text-align: center; margin: 32px 0 16px; }
    .btn { display: inline-block; background: #334155; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; padding: 12px 24px; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 500; font-size: 14px; }
    .footer { background: #f8fafc; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding: 24px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #64748b; }
    .footer a { color: #334155; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 500; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>New Task Assigned</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="content">
      <p style="margin-top: 0;">Hi {{recipientName}},</p>
      <p><strong>{{assignerName}}</strong> has assigned a new task to you. Please check out your task below:</p>
      
      <div class="task-box">
        <h2 class="task-title">{{taskTitle}}</h2>
        <p style="margin: 8px 0 0; font-size: 13px; color: #64748b;"><strong>Department:</strong> {{departmentName}}</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="btn-container">
        <a href="{{taskUrl}}" class="btn">Check out your task</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      <p>You received this email because you have notifications enabled for new task assignments.</p>
      <p><a href="{{preferencesUrl}}">Manage Notification Preferences</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
